00:07:33,913 --> 00:07:39,913
The King and I is a animation, family, music film directed by Richard Rich.

3
00:11:20,869 --> 00:11:26,869
Widowed Welsh mother Anna Loenowens becomes a governess and English tutor to the
wives and many children of the stubborn King Mongkut of Siam.

4
00:15:07,826 --> 00:15:13,826
Anna and the King have a clash of personalities as she works to teach the royal family about the English language, customs and
etiquette, and rushes to prepare a party for a group of European diplomats who must change their opinions about the King.

5
